 "ja485:1.1": "“Upanīyatidaṁ maññe, ", "ja485:1.2": "cande lohitamaddane; ", "ja485:1.3": "Ajja jahāmi jīvitaṁ, ", "ja485:1.4": "pāṇā me cande nirujjhanti. ", "ja485:2.1": "Osīdi me dukkhaṁ hadayaṁ, ", "ja485:2.2": "Me ḍayhate nitammāmi; ", "ja485:2.3": "Tava candiyā socantiyā, ", "ja485:2.4": "Na naṁ aññehi sokehi. ", "ja485:3.1": "Tiṇamiva vanamiva milāyāmi, ", "ja485:3.2": "Nadī aparipuṇṇāva sussāmi; ", "ja485:3.3": "Tava candiyā socantiyā, ", "ja485:3.4": "Na naṁ aññehi sokehi. ", "ja485:4.1": "Vassamiva sare pāde, ", "ja485:4.2": "Imāni assūni vattare mayhaṁ; ", "ja485:4.3": "Tava candiyā socantiyā, ", "ja485:4.4": "Na naṁ aññehi sokehi”. ", "ja485:5.1": "“Pāpo khosi rājaputta, ", "ja485:5.2": "Yo me icchitaṁ patiṁ varākiyā; ", "ja485:5.3": "Vijjhasi vanamūlasmiṁ, ", "ja485:5.4": "Soyaṁ viddho chamā seti. ", "ja485:6.1": "Imaṁ mayhaṁ hadayasokaṁ, ", "ja485:6.2": "Paṭimuñcatu rājaputta tava mātā; ", "ja485:6.3": "Yo mayhaṁ hadayasoko, ", "ja485:6.4": "Kimpurisaṁ avekkhamānāya. ", "ja485:7.1": "Imaṁ mayhaṁ hadayasokaṁ, ", "ja485:7.2": "Paṭimuñcatu rājaputta tava jāyā; ", "ja485:7.3": "Yo mayhaṁ hadayasoko, ", "ja485:7.4": "Kimpurisaṁ avekkhamānāya. ", "ja485:8.1": "Mā ca puttaṁ mā ca patiṁ, ", "ja485:8.2": "Addakkhi rājaputta tava mātā; ", "ja485:8.3": "Yo kimpurisaṁ avadhi, ", "ja485:8.4": "Adūsakaṁ mayha kāmā hi. ", "ja485:9.1": "Mā ca puttaṁ mā ca patiṁ, ", "ja485:9.2": "Addakkhi rājaputta tava jāyā; ", "ja485:9.3": "Yo kimpurisaṁ avadhi, ", "ja485:9.4": "Adūsakaṁ mayha kāmā hi”. ", "ja485:10.1": "“Mā tvaṁ cande rodi, ", "ja485:10.2": "Mā soci vanatimiramattakkhi; ", "ja485:10.3": "Mama tvaṁ hehisi bhariyā, ", "ja485:10.4": "Rājakule pūjitā nārībhi”. ", "ja485:11.1": "“Api nūnahaṁ marissaṁ, ", "ja485:11.2": "Nāhaṁ rājaputta tava hessaṁ; ", "ja485:11.3": "Yo kimpurisaṁ avadhi, ", "ja485:11.4": "Adūsakaṁ mayha kāmā hi”. ", "ja485:12.1": "“Api bhīruke api jīvitukāmike, ", "ja485:12.2": "Kimpurisi gaccha himavantaṁ; ", "ja485:12.3": "Tālīsatagarabhojanā, ", "ja485:12.4": "Aññe taṁ migā ramissanti”. ", "ja485:13.1": "“Te pabbatā tā ca kandarā, ", "ja485:13.2": "Tā ca giriguhāyo tatheva tiṭṭhanti; ", "ja485:13.3": "Tattheva taṁ apassantī, ", "ja485:13.4": "Kimpurisa kathaṁ ahaṁ kassaṁ. ", "ja485:14.1": "Te paṇṇasanthatā ramaṇīyā, ", "ja485:14.2": "Vāḷamigehi anuciṇṇā; ", "ja485:14.3": "Tattheva taṁ apassantī, ", "ja485:14.4": "Kimpurisa kathaṁ ahaṁ kassaṁ. ", "ja485:15.1": "Te pupphasanthatā ramaṇīyā, ", "ja485:15.2": "Vāḷamigehi anuciṇṇā; ", "ja485:15.3": "Tattheva taṁ apassantī, ", "ja485:15.4": "Kimpurisa kathaṁ ahaṁ kassaṁ. ", "ja485:16.1": "Acchā savanti girivananadiyo, ", "ja485:16.2": "Kusumābhikiṇṇasotāyo; ", "ja485:16.3": "Tattheva taṁ apassantī, ", "ja485:16.4": "Kimpurisa kathaṁ ahaṁ kassaṁ. ", "ja485:17.1": "Nīlāni himavato pabbatassa, ", "ja485:17.2": "Kūṭāni dassanīyāni; ", "ja485:17.3": "Tattheva taṁ apassantī, ", "ja485:17.4": "Kimpurisa kathaṁ ahaṁ kassaṁ. ", "ja485:18.1": "Pītāni himavato pabbatassa, ", "ja485:18.2": "Kūṭāni dassanīyāni; ", "ja485:18.3": "Tattheva taṁ apassantī, ", "ja485:18.4": "Kimpurisa kathaṁ ahaṁ kassaṁ. ", "ja485:19.1": "Tambāni himavato pabbatassa, ", "ja485:19.2": "Kūṭāni dassanīyāni; ", "ja485:19.3": "Tattheva taṁ apassantī, ", "ja485:19.4": "Kimpurisa kathaṁ ahaṁ kassaṁ. ", "ja485:20.1": "Tuṅgāni himavato pabbatassa, ", "ja485:20.2": "Kūṭāni dassanīyāni; ", "ja485:20.3": "Tattheva taṁ apassantī, ", "ja485:20.4": "Kimpurisa kathaṁ ahaṁ kassaṁ. ", "ja485:21.1": "Setāni himavato pabbatassa, ", "ja485:21.2": "Kūṭāni dassanīyāni; ", "ja485:21.3": "Tattheva taṁ apassantī, ", "ja485:21.4": "Kimpurisa kathaṁ ahaṁ kassaṁ. ", "ja485:22.1": "Citrāni himavato pabbatassa, ", "ja485:22.2": "Kūṭāni dassanīyāni; ", "ja485:22.3": "Tattheva taṁ apassantī, ", "ja485:22.4": "Kimpurisa kathaṁ ahaṁ kassaṁ. ", "ja485:23.1": "Yakkhagaṇasevite gandhamādane, ", "ja485:23.2": "Osadhebhi sañchanne; ", "ja485:23.3": "Tattheva taṁ apassantī, ", "ja485:23.4": "Kimpurisa kathaṁ ahaṁ kassaṁ. ", "ja485:24.1": "Kimpurisasevite gandhamādane, ", "ja485:24.2": "Osadhebhi sañchanne; ", "ja485:24.3": "Tattheva taṁ apassantī, ", "ja485:24.4": "Kimpurisa kathaṁ ahaṁ kassaṁ”. ", "ja485:25.1": "“Vande te ayirabrahme, ", "ja485:25.2": "Yo me icchitaṁ patiṁ varākiyā; ", "ja485:25.3": "Amatena abhisiñci, ", "ja485:25.4": "Samāgatāsmi piyatamena. ", "ja485:26.1": "Vicarāma dāni girivana nadiyo, ", "ja485:26.2": "Kusumābhikiṇṇasotāyo; ", "ja485:26.3": "Nānādumavasanāyo, ", "ja485:26.4": "Piyaṁvadā aññamaññassā”ti. ", "ja485:27.1": "Candakinnarījātakaṁ dutiyaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja485:0.1": "", "ja485:0.2": "", "ja485:0.3": "", "ja485:0.4": "", "ja485:1.1": "", "ja485:1.2": "lohitamaddane … pāṇā → lohitamadena majjāmi; vijahāmi jīvitaṁ pāṇā (si, pts1ed); lohitamaddane; ajjāpi vijahāmi jīvitaṁ pāṇā (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja485:1.3": "", "ja485:1.4": "", "ja485:2.1": "Osīdi → osadhi (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1); osaṭṭhi (mr); osati (abhinavaṭīkā); osīdati (?) | dukkhaṁ → dukkhaṁ me (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja485:2.2": "", "ja485:2.3": "", "ja485:2.4": "", "ja485:3.1": "milāyāmi → miyyāmi (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja485:3.2": "aparipuṇṇāva → aparipuṇṇiyāva (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja485:3.3": "", "ja485:3.4": "", "ja485:4.1": "Vassamiva sare pāde → vassaṁva sare pāde (bj); vassaṁva sare pabbatapāde (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja485:4.2": "", "ja485:4.3": "", "ja485:4.4": "", "ja485:5.1": "Pāpo khosi → pāposi kho (bj); pāpo kho (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja485:5.2": "icchitaṁ → icchita (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja485:5.3": "", "ja485:5.4": "", "ja485:6.1": "", "ja485:6.2": "", "ja485:6.3": "", "ja485:6.4": "", "ja485:7.1": "", "ja485:7.2": "", "ja485:7.3": "", "ja485:7.4": "", "ja485:8.1": "puttaṁ → putte (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja485:8.2": "", "ja485:8.3": "", "ja485:8.4": "mayha kāmā hi → mayhaṁ kāmāhi (sya1ed, sya2ed); mayhaṁ kāmā (mr) ", "ja485:9.1": "", "ja485:9.2": "", "ja485:9.3": "", "ja485:9.4": "", "ja485:10.1": "", "ja485:10.2": "", "ja485:10.3": "", "ja485:10.4": "nārībhi → nārī (